# The carpet's steering toward its cruising speed across (CarpetCruiseX,
# $81:E643), called by JSR from the first ride's frame (PlayerCarpet). The
# ride's own calls sit too deep in the actor loop's calls for a full A5
# run to judge them; unit calls by JSR on Aladdin's record on the first
# ride (stage a2 s1, level 7; M and X 8-bit, DB $80), his speed across
# ($08F4) set to $0100 (below $0300: direction 9, sped up) and to $0400
# (direction 8, slowed), the machine put back after each.
load build/aladdin/states/stage_a2_s1.state
wait 10
set $0008F4 00,01,00
call 81E643 d=08DB db=80 p=30
set $0008F4 00,04,00
call 81E643 d=08DB db=80 p=30
